  "body": "## What's changed\r\n\r\n### Task Archiving\r\nArchive completed or stale tasks to keep your active workspace clean without deleting the JSON files.\r\n\r\n### Full-text search\r\nThe search bar finds matches in task's descriptions as well now.\r\n\r\n### Task encryption\r\nEncrypt your task and project files at rest using AES-256-GCM for enhanced privacy.\r\n- Encrypted files are stored as base64-encoded text (git-friendly)\r\n- Generate a key with `yatto key generate`\r\n- Enable in config: `[encryption] enable = true` with `key_path` pointing to your key file\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* d9422e51b7c9322c5123885d38f886548e56d98d chore(version): v1.4.0\r\n* 77174f9fa64cd74c5a28187b2f9fe7a7fa2e7760 feat: task archiving and full text search (#102)\r\n* 9e188d46046795d459235db397686bc43810efca feat: task encryption (#103)\r\n\r\n"
